@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam stateBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam stateStartColor #60C7E5
skinparam stateEndColor #60C7E5
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title AFTER MVP — SM-M08 — Usable provider capability versus disconnected data
state "Not connected /\ndisconnected" as Disconnected
state "Current provider capability\nusable" as Usable
state "Provider capability\nunavailable" as Unavailable
[*] --> Disconnected : scoped initial context
Disconnected --> Usable : SM-T045 connection confirmed\n[actual authorized capability]
Usable --> Unavailable : SM-T046 access lost / revoked\n[capability no longer usable]
Usable --> Disconnected : SM-T047 disconnect confirmed\n[authorized / confirmed]
Unavailable --> Disconnected : SM-T048 disconnect confirmed\n[authorized / confirmed]
Unavailable --> Usable : SM-T049 reconnect verified\n[identity / permission\nverified]
Usable --> Usable : SM-T050 grants re-evaluated\n[selected capability still valid]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
